repository-artifact: "https://github.com/multi2mech/SIMBA/releases"
abstract: >
  SIMBA (SIMulation Buffered Animation) is an open-source Unity framework
  for interactive visualization of animated scientific simulations.
  It supports dynamic topology, animated scalar fields, efficient binary
  storage, and GPU-accelerated rendering for scientific and engineering
  applications.

